# Design System

Every value is a CSS custom property in `app/globals.css` (`:root` and `@theme inline`). Reference it with `var()` or the matching utility. Never hard-code a clamp, colour, tracking, leading, shadow or z-index. The published reference is the "Amr Abu-Talleb" Design System artifact.

## Type Scale

A custom optical scale: roughly a Major Third for body sizes, a Perfect Fourth for headings.

| Token | Variable | Computed | Usage |
|-------|----------|----------|-------|
| **Hero** | `--text-hero` | 38→92px (height-aware) | Homepage h1 only |
| **Display** | `--text-display` | 44.8→120px | 404 |
| **Page Title** | `--text-page` | 40→72px | Page h1 |
| **Section Heading** | `--text-section` | 32→56px | h2, marquee names, footer words |
| **Sub Heading** | `--text-sub` | 24→40px | h3, stat numbers, case-study card titles |
| **Quote** | `--text-quote` | 24→40px | Testimonial quote (Playfair italic) |
| **Quote mark** | `--text-quote-mark` | 112→128px | The opening “ above a testimonial |
| **Service Title** | `--text-service-sm` / `--text-service-lg` | 24 / 30px | `text-2xl lg:text-3xl` |
| **Body XL** | `--text-body-xl` | 20px | `text-xl` |
| **Body Large** | `--text-body-lg` | 18px | `text-lg` |
| **Article** | `--text-article` | 17px | `text-[length:var(--text-article)]` |
| **Body** | `--text-body` | 16px | `text-base` (default) |
| **Body Small** | `--text-body-sm` | 14px | `text-sm` |
| **Caption** | `--text-caption` | 12px | `text-xs` |
| **Micro** | `--text-micro` | 10px | `text-[length:var(--text-micro)]` |

No other sizes: no `text-[15px]`, `text-[11px]` or raw clamps. The minimum is 10px.

## Font Families

### Inter (sans-serif): `font-sans`
- Body text, UI, labels, navigation.
- **Body (14–16px):** no extra tracking.
- **Small text (10–12px) and uppercase:** always `--tracking-label` or `--tracking-sublabel`.
- **Weight:** 400 body, 500 labels and buttons, 600 sub-labels. 700 only for the nav wordmark "Amr Abu-Talleb".

### Playfair Display (serif): `font-serif`
- Every heading, display number, marquee name and quote. Headings are never set in Inter.
- **Weight:** 400 only. Never bold.
- **Styles loaded:** roman and italic (`style: ["normal", "italic"]` in `app/layout.tsx`). Italic is for quotes only.
- **Tracking:** `--tracking-display` (-0.03em) for hero and display, `tracking-tight` (-0.025em) for the rest.
- **Minimum size:** 24px (`text-2xl`). Below that the hairlines break up.

